{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9858c900-5e63-8c53-aa74-0daa8aded35a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T11:35:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Doug Lawton",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:20-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, hello. I am calling about a hole in the road. Not a hole exactly, a dip. It is getting worse every week and I am tired of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:31-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Let's get it written down. Where is the dip?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:37-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One hundred forty Dixon Street. North End. Right in front of my shop, almost at the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One forty Dixon Street. And you said a dip, so not a pothole as such. What's it look like?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:32:52-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last fall, they dig trench for utility. Gas, I think, or cable, I do not know. They fill it, they put asphalt on top. Now the fill settled. Is long strip, maybe six feet, and sinks down like this, a few inches. Every car goes bang."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:33:09-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the utility cut was patched and it's settled since. A long sunken strip, about six feet, in front of the driveway at one forty."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:33:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. And this is not first time I say. I call in January also. Nobody comes. Nothing changes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, that's frustrating when it's still sitting there. I'll put this in as a new request with all those details, and note that it's a repeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:33:37-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Because yesterday my van hit it hard, with the delivery boxes. I think something is bent underneath. Does the city pay for damage to car? Reimburse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:33:47-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a claims process for vehicle damage, but I can't tell you whether it would be approved. That goes through a separate office. I can have someone from there get in touch, or give you the way to file it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please, give me the way. I will take photos of the dip and the receipt from mechanic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:09-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's smart, keep both. Hang on one second while I finish entering this. [pause] Okay, it's in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I have reference number? Last time I had nothing, so nobody can find my call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Let me read it to you. It's request number P-W, four, four, one, seven, two. Do you have something to write with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, one moment. [pause] Okay. P-W, four, four, one, seven, two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. And I have your number as four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-seven, is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct. Please, when does crew come? I have to leave soon. After-school care ends at five thirty sharp, I cannot be late, they charge me every minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:34:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I can't give you a date, because the crews go by priority, but I'll mark it so the supervisor sees that it's a repeat complaint with possible vehicle damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I hope this time somebody looks. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:09-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Lawton. Keep that reference number handy, and I'll have the claims information sent over as well. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:35:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
